      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786050000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FREEZE AND PREVALIDATE BEFORE CREDENTIAL OR NETWORK ACCESS\nprivate workload/trace bytes -> SHA-256 + byte count -> strict parse + representative bodies + exact fixed schedule/every sweep rung\n-> optional quota + READY direct-P2T gate (full JSON bytes + framing; synthetic CPT max(configured,12)) -> paid preflight by default (skippable)\n-> journal claimed; metadata-only setup rows appended; raw prompts excluded from durable run artifacts",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FREEZE AND PREVALIDATE BEFORE CREDENTIAL OR NETWORK ACCESS\nprivate workload/trace bytes -> SHA-256 + byte count -> strict parse + representative bodies + exact fixed schedule/every sweep rung\n-> optional quota + READY direct-P2T gate (full JSON bytes + framing; synthetic CPT max(configured,12)) -> paid preflight by default (skippable)\n-> journal claimed; metadata-only setup rows appended; raw prompts excluded from durable run artifacts",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
